    "created_at": "2025-02-19T17:05:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-19T17:05:09Z",
    "body": "Makes sense. I do think it would be good if we made the processing model more explicit, so there's less chance for misinterpretation and issues like this. But that would be quite the refactor.",
