    "created_at": "2025-03-12T14:35:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-12T14:35:14Z",
    "body": "@Kaiido you're right, it's not a user interaction event like \"click\". The spec should be clarified to say that any promises created by the native video controls should be handled, so that no \"unhandledrejection\" event can fire.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
